  ActivityType, AgentRole, AmlMethod, AmlStatus, ChecklistKey, CommissionBasis, CommissionPayer, Condition, ConsentStatus,
  ContactKind, ContactRole, DealStage, DealStatus, DemandStatus, DocStatus, EnergyClass, ExclusivityType, Feature, IdDocument,
